  "additional": {
    "aboutAssay": "",
    "forReview": "The kit is functional as the standard curve looks good. However, it did not detect any of the either regular or ethanol-extracted serum samples. The average spike recovery is ~83% and it is getting higher with the dilution factor. It seems it has a matrix effect as well as the coated antigen has limitation to bind equine serum adipnectin as this kit is designed for the detection of porcine adiponectin."
  },
